From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <d.darrigo@outlook.it>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:49:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ec/lenovo/h8: Read no EC RAM in the AC adapter _PSR before
 _REG

As the _STA of the batteries and the _LID of the lid: macOS evaluates
_PSR at boot before its EC driver is up and logs "No handler for Region
[ERAM]", twice on the W541 with the batteries and the lid fixed. Until
_REG (3, 1) return PWRS, the last state known (1, on AC, at boot), and
have _REG notify the AC device (0x80) when the handler arrives, so that
the OS reads it again. Linux evaluates _REG before it binds the AC
device: nothing changes there.

TEST=Built lenovo/w541 with mrc.bin and with the native RAM init. In
acpiexec on its DSDT with the EC on battery: after _REG (3, 0) _PSR
returns 1 without reading the EC and notifies nothing; after _REG
(3, 1), which notifies AC with 0x80, it returns 0 and notifies the
CPUs once; back on AC it returns 1. The other ACPI checks give the same
results as before.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ac.asl |  5 +++++
 src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ec.asl | 12 +++++++-----
 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ac.asl b/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ac.asl
index 4477301ec1..6bb6d67a1e 100644
--- a/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ac.asl
+++ b/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ac.asl
@@ -20,6 +20,11 @@ Device(AC)
 	 */
 	Method(_PSR, 0, NotSerialized)
 	{
+		/* Before _REG (3, 1): the last state known, no EC access */
+		If (!ECAV) {
+			Return (\PWRS)
+		}
+
 		Local0 = HPAC
 		If (\PWRS != Local0)
 		{
diff --git a/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ec.asl b/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ec.asl
index 9b24e808a7..03e1eaec49 100644
--- a/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ec.asl
+++ b/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/ec.asl
@@ -70,9 +70,10 @@ Device(EC)
 
 	/*
 	 * 1 while the OS has a handler for ERAM, from _REG (3, 1): until then
-	 * AML must not read ERAM (ACPI 6.5, 6.5.4). The _STA of the batteries
-	 * and the _LID of the lid check it, as an OS may evaluate them before
-	 * its EC driver is up (macOS: "No handler for Region [ERAM]").
+	 * AML must not read ERAM (ACPI 6.5, 6.5.4). The _STA of the batteries,
+	 * the _LID of the lid and the _PSR of the AC adapter check it, as an
+	 * OS may evaluate them before its EC driver is up (macOS: "No handler
+	 * for Region [ERAM]").
 	 */
 	Name (ECAV, 0)
 
@@ -94,13 +95,14 @@ Device(EC)
 		}
 
 		/*
-		 * The batteries and the lid now read the EC: let the OS check
-		 * them again
+		 * The batteries, the lid and the AC adapter now read the EC:
+		 * let the OS check them again
 		 */
 		If ((Arg0 == 3) && (Arg1 == 1)) {
 			Notify (BAT0, 0x81)
 			Notify (BAT1, 0x81)
 			Notify (LID, 0x80)
+			Notify (AC, 0x80)
 		}
 	}
 
